   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Mikrokrediter i Kosovo</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Finance Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;len med insatsen &#xe4;r att:&#xe5;terst&#xe4;lla och utveckla den lokala produktionskapaciteten inom jordbruket, &#xe5;terst&#xe4;lla och utveckla jordbrukstj&#xe4;nster hos b&#xe5;de frist&#xe5;ende b&#xf6;nder liksom hos st&#xf6;rre producenter,successivt etablera ett h&#xe5;llbart &#xf6;msesidigt samh&#xe4;llsbaserat &quot;kredit/sparandesystem. Genomf&#xf6;rande part &#xe4;r ADIE International.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general purpose of the project is to develop a rural finance institution through local Savings and Credit Associations. The project assists farmers and rural micro-entrepreneurs in i.a.: restoring and developing agricultural production capacity,restoring and developing rural services. Implementing organisation is ADIE International.</narrative>
  </description>
